  "full_text": "Yeah, as far as I'm concerned, I spend my time on Moses Mountain. And I don't know, am I making war plans? Not exactly. What could possibly go wrong hanging out on Moses Mountain? Like, dude, I'm just hanging out talking to God. Like, it's all under control. Bam! What are you talking about? You mean I'm supposed to do shit? Well, of course. What are you talking about? I'm just hanging out on Moses Mountain getting divine revelation. What could possibly go wrong? I just saw a YouTube video about, I don't know, some naval battle in World War II. So somebody politely told me, dude, man, you're probably not qualified to run the military. That's good. I agree. So, like, fuck it. So, like, maybe I just be like, maybe I'm king, but I just fucking, I just, like, reveal all this fucking shit. See what happens. I don't know. See what happens. What could possibly go wrong on Moses Mountain? So, like, yeah, you know, just fucking hang out. Talk to God. What's God saying? Oh, I have a bunch of stuff I was going to keep saying. I just lost my train of thought. Too many donuts. They're talking about oinking. Mr. Terry, you're eating too much, what do you call it? God said I'm oinking. You know, Mr. Pig. Dude, maybe I'd like stop hanging out at Moses Mountain eating the donuts. What? You ever heard of spiritual gluttony? No. I'm God's best friend. Go fuck yourself. Where are you getting a watch? What? What are they talking about? So I had more revelations I was going to go ahead and share, but now I'm starting to think about it. Ah, fuck it. What?",
